  "date": "2026-08-07",
  "headline": "First human case of West Nile virus reported in Kern County: Public Health",
  "url": "/briefs/2026-08-07/",
  "content": "\n    <article class=\"article-lead brief-read\">\n      <div class=\"greet\"><p><strong>Good morning, Kern County.</strong> \u2014 today&rsquo;s high should land near 107&deg;, a Heat Advisory is in effect, air quality sits at 65. <strong>First human case of West Nile virus reported in Kern County: Public Health</strong> is the big story we&rsquo;re watching today \u2014 full rundown below.</p></div>\n\n      <section class=\"brief-seg\" aria-labelledby=\"seg-weather\">\n        <div class=\"sign-head\"><span class=\"tab\">Weather</span><h2 id=\"seg-weather\">Today's weather</h2></div>\n        <figure class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/skyline.jpg\" alt=\"Bakersfield skyline panorama\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"568\"><figcaption>Photo: Bobak Ha'Eri &middot; CC BY 3.0 &middot; <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2008-0621-Bakersfield-pan.JPG\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure>\n        <div class=\"card\"><p>Expect a high near 107\u00b0 and a low around 76\u00b0 tonight.</p><p>It's currently 91\u00b0 at Meadows Field (KBFL).</p><p><strong>Heat Advisory</strong>: Heat Advisory issued August 7 at 2:32PM PDT until August 9 at 8:00PM PDT by NWS Hanford CA</p><p>Air quality is 65 \u2014 moderate.</p><p>Fire crews are on 2 active fires in Kern (Cassie Fire, Buzzard Fire).</p></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"brief-seg\" aria-labelledby=\"seg-news\">\n        <div class=\"sign-head\"><span class=\"tab\">News</span><h2 id=\"seg-news\">Top stories</h2></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><ul class=\"story-list\"><li><a href=\"https://www.kget.com/news/local-news/first-human-case-of-west-nile-virus-reported-in-kern-county-public-health/\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Top story:</strong> First human case of West Nile virus reported in Kern County: Public Health \u2014 <em>via KGET 17.</em></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.kget.com/news/local-news/a-directorial-debut-with-bakersfield-roots/\" rel=\"noopener\">A directorial debut with Bakersfield roots</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.kget.com/news/local-news/a-look-back-at-arvin-lamont-and-weedpatch/\" rel=\"noopener\">A look back at Arvin, Lamont and Weedpatch</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.kget.com/news/local-news/its-very-surreal-delano-teenager-gets-new-clarinet-through-make-a-wish/\" rel=\"noopener\">&#x27;It&#x27;s very surreal:&#x27; Delano teenager gets new clarinet through Make-A-Wish</a></li></ul><p class=\"note\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Summaries are written from the headline and link to the original outlet for details.</p></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"brief-seg\" aria-labelledby=\"seg-good\">\n        <div class=\"sign-head good-head\"><h2 id=\"seg-good\">Something good</h2></div>\n        \n        <div class=\"card pos-card\">\n          <img class=\"thumb\" src=\"../../assets/img/fair.jpg\" alt=\"Kern County Fair\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"857\">\n          <div class=\"pos-body\">\n            <span class=\"cat-tag\">Family fun</span>\n            <h3><a href=\"https://www.mechanicsbankarena.com/event/blueys-big-play/145/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Blueys Big Play</a></h3>\n            <p>Mechanics Bank Arena &middot; Fri, Aug 14 \u2014 a good one to put on the calendar.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"brief-seg\" aria-labelledby=\"seg-events\">\n        <div class=\"sign-head\"><span class=\"tab\">Out</span><h2 id=\"seg-events\">Upcoming \u2014 concerts, comedy &amp; more</h2></div>\n        <figure class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/amtrak.jpg\" alt=\"Bakersfield Amtrak station\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\"><figcaption>Photo: LHOON &middot; CC BY-SA 2.0 &middot; <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bakersfield_Amtrak_Station.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure>\n        \n    <div class=\"card\"><ul class=\"ev-lis