  "url": "/briefs/2026-08-09/",
  "content": "\n    <article class=\"article-lead brief-read\">\n      <div class=\"greet\"><p><strong>Good morning, Kern County.</strong> \u2014 today&rsquo;s high should land near 107&deg;, a Extreme Heat Warning is in effect, air quality sits at 58. <strong>Former Bakersfield College teacher needs lung transplant</strong> is the big story we&rsquo;re watching today \u2014 full rundown below.</p></div>\n\n      <section class=\"brief-seg\" aria-labelledby=\"seg-weather\">\n        <div class=\"sign-head\"><span class=\"tab\">Weather</span><h2 id=\"seg-weather\">Today's weather</h2></div>\n        <figure class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/skyline.jpg\" alt=\"Bakersfield skyline panorama\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"568\"><figcaption>Photo: Bobak Ha'Eri &middot; CC BY 3.0 &middot; <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2008-0621-Bakersfield-pan.JPG\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure>\n        <div class=\"card\"><p>Expect a high near 107\u00b0 and a low around 76\u00b0 tonight.</p><p>It's currently 91\u00b0 at Meadows Field (KBFL).</p><p><strong>Extreme Heat Warning</strong>: Extreme Heat Warning issued August 9 at 7:51PM PDT until August 10 at 8:00PM PDT by NWS Hanford CA</p><p>Air quality is 58 \u2014 moderate.</p><p>Fire crews are on 3 active fires in Kern (Cassie Fire, Buzzard Fire, Antelope Fire).</p></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"brief-seg\" aria-labelledby=\"seg-news\">\n        <div class=\"sign-head\"><span class=\"tab\">News</span><h2 id=\"seg-news\">Top stories</h2></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><ul class=\"story-list\"><li><a href=\"https://www.turnto23.com/news/in-your-neighborhood/bakersfield/former-bakersfield-college-teacher-needs-lung-transplant\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Top story:</strong> Former Bakersfield College teacher needs lung transplant \u2014 <em>via 23ABC.</em></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.turnto23.com/news/in-your-neighborhood/bakersfield/links-fo