 {
  "date": "2026-08-10",
  "headline": "It\u2019s hot enough to fry candy corn on the sidewalk, but Halloween in August? Sure",
  "url": "/briefs/2026-08-10/",
  "content": "\n    <article class=\"article-lead brief-read\">\n      <div class=\"greet\"><p><strong>Good morning, Kern County.</strong> \u2014 today&rsquo;s high should land near 104&deg;, air quality sits at 63. <strong>It\u2019s hot enough to fry candy corn on the sidewalk, but Halloween in August? Sure</strong> is the big story we&rsquo;re watching today \u2014 full rundown below.</p></div>\n\n      \n    <section class=\"brief-seg\" aria-labelledby=\"seg-overnight\">\n      <div class=\"sign-head\"><span class=\"tab\">Overnight</span><h2 id=\"seg-overnight\">The Kern Overnight</h2></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><p>3 structure fires on the east side, 2 traffic collisions, 2 welfare calls downtown, and 9 more \u2014 16 incidents total. <a href=\"../../overnight/\">See the full overnight breakdown &rarr;</a></p>\n      <p class=\"note\">Locations generalized to block or cross streets &middot; details preliminary.</p></div>\n      <p class=\"trans-note\">How the Kern Overnight report is made: archived public-safety radio audio is transcribed to text by a speech-to-text model, and the morning report is written from that dispatch log. Locations are generalized to block or cross streets, and every detail is preliminary until confirmed by an official source.</p>\n    </section>\n\n      <section class=\"brief-seg\" aria-labelledby=\"seg-weather\">\n        <div class=\"sign-head\"><span class=\"tab\">Weather</span><h2 id=\"seg-weather\">Today's weather</h2></div>\n        <figure class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/bakersfield.jpg\" alt=\"Golden hour over Bakersfield and the Kern County fields\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\"></figure>\n        <div class=\"card\"><p>Expect a high near 104\u00b0 and a low around 74\u00b0 tonight.</p><p>It's currently 90\u00b0 at Meadows Field (KBFL).</p><p>No active weather alerts for Kern County.</p><p>Air quality is 63 \u2014 moderate.</p><p>Fire crews are on 2 active fires in Kern (Buzzard Fire, Antelope Fire).</p></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"brief-seg\" aria-labelledby=\"seg-news\">\n        <div class=\"sign-head\"><span class=\"tab\">News</span><h2 id=\"seg-news\">Top stories</h2></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><ul class=\"story-list\"><li><a href=\"https://www.kget.com/news/local-news/its-hot-enough-to-fry-candy-corn-on-the-sidewalk-but-halloween-in-august-sure/\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Top story:</strong> It\u2019s hot enough to fry candy corn on the sidewalk, but Halloween in August? Sure \u2014 <em>via KGET 17.</em></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.kget.com/news/politics/your-local-elections/kern-hispanic-chamber-holds-discussion-over-controversial-voter-id-ballot-measure/\" rel=\"noopener\">Kern Hispanic Chamber of Commerce holds discussion over controversial voter ID ballot measure</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.turnto23.com/news/in-your-neighborhood/bakersfield/kern-county-residents-debate-prop-39-voter-id-requirements\" rel=\"noopener\">Kern County residents debate Prop. 39 voter ID requirements</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.turnto23.com/news/in-your-neighborhood/frazier-park-grapevine/how-chp-manages-i-5-closures-during-wildfires-near-the-grapevine\" rel=\"noopener\">How CHP manages I-5 closures during wildfires near the Grapevine</a></li></ul><p class=\"note\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Summaries are written from the headline and link to the original outlet for details.</p></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"brief-seg\" aria-labelledby=\"seg-good\">\n        <div class=\"sign-head good-head\"><h2 id=\"seg-good\">Something good</h2></div>\n        \n        <div class=\"card pos-card\">\n          <img class=\"thumb\" src=\"../../assets/img/fair.jpg\" alt=\"Kern County Fair\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"857\">\n          <div class=\"pos-body\">\n            <span class=\"cat-tag\">Family fun</span>\n            <h3><a href=\"https://www.mechanicsbankarena.com/event/blueys-big-play/145/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Blueys Big Play</a></h3>\n            <p>Mechanics Bank Arena &middot; Fri, Aug 14 \u2014 a good one to put on the calendar.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"brief-seg\" aria-labelledby=\"seg-events\">\n        <div class=\"sign-head\"><span class=\"tab\">Out</span><h2 id=\"seg-events\">Upcoming \u2014 concerts, comedy &amp; more</h2></div>\n        <figure class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/amtrak.jpg\" alt=\"Bakersfield Amtrak station\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\"><figcaption>Photo: LHOON &middot; CC BY-SA 2.0 &middot; <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bakersfield_Amtrak_Station.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure>\n        \n    <div class=\"card\"><ul class=\"ev-list\">\n        <li class=\"ev-row\"><span class=\"ev-date\">Fri 14</span>\n        <span class=\"ev-body\"><a href=\"https://thebakersfieldfox.com/events/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>PEPPER With CYDEWAYS</strong></a>\n        <span class=\"ev-venue\">Fox Theater</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"ev-row\"><span class=\"ev-date\">Fri 14</span>\n        <span class=\"ev-body\"><a href=\"https://www.mechanicsbankarena.com/event/gavin-adcock/147/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Gavin Adcock</strong></a>\n        <span class=\"ev-venue\">Mechanics Bank Arena</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"ev-row\"><span class=\"ev-date\">Fri 14</span>\n        <span class=\"ev-body\"><a href=\"https://www.mechanicsbankarena.com/event/brit-floyd/146/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Brit Floyd</strong></a>\n        <span class=\"ev-venue\">Mechanics Bank Arena</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"ev-row\"><span class=\"ev-date\">Fri 14</span>\n        <span class=\"ev-body\"><a href=\"https://www.mechanicsbankarena.com/event/blueys-big-play/145/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Blueys Big Play</strong></a>\