hy Neighborhoods Committee</strong></a>\n        <span class=\"ev-venue\">Public meeting</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"ev-row\"><span class=\"ev-date\">2026-08-13 12:00</span>\n        <span class=\"ev-body\"><a href=\"https://pub-bakersfield.escribemeetings.com/Meeting.aspx?Id=884dbbaa-c067-4548-93db-7d94c8ba9c71&amp;Agenda=Agenda&amp;lang=English\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Housing and Community Development Committee</strong></a>\n        <span class=\"ev-venue\">Public meeting</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"ev-row\"><span class=\"ev-date\">2026-08-14 12:00</span>\n        <span class=\"ev-body\"><a href=\"https://pub-bakersfield.escribemeetings.com/Meeting.aspx?Id=55986a0e-5c90-4f3c-ada2-e05f97404f93&amp;Agenda=Agenda&amp;lang=English\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Special Laws and Legislation Committee</strong></a>\n        <span class=\"ev-venue\">Public meeting</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"ev-row\"><span class=\"ev-date\">2026-08-10 15:00</span>\n        <span class=\"ev-body\"><a href=\"https://pub-bakersfield.escribemeetings.com/Meeting.aspx?Id=2ec6ec25-711a-4a4c-b5e5-195ed060c1c7&amp;Agenda=Agenda&amp;lang=English\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Fire Civil Service Commission</strong></a>\n        <span class=\"ev-venue\">Public meeting</span></span></li>\n            <li class=\"ev-row\"><span class=\"ev-date\">2026-08-11</span>\n            <span class=\"ev-body\"><a href=\"../../city-hall/county-board/\"><strong>Board of Supervisors</strong></a>\n            <span class=\"ev-venue\">Kern County</span></span></li></ul>\n      <p class=\"note\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">Meetings from official agendas. See\n      <a href=\"../../city-hall/\">all city &amp; county meetings</a>.</p>\n    </section>"
