 {
  "date": "2026-08-11",
  "headline": "California City to search for new city manager amid ongoing 'revolving door' concerns for the position",
  "url": "/briefs/2026-08-11/",
  "content": "\n    <article class=\"article-lead brief-read\">\n      <div class=\"greet\"><p><strong>Good morning, Kern County.</strong> \u2014 today&rsquo;s high should land near 103&deg;, a Flood Advisory is in effect, air quality sits at 86. <strong>California City to search for new city manager amid ongoing &#x27;revolving door&#x27; concerns for the position</strong> is the big story we&rsquo;re watching today \u2014 full rundown below.</p></div>\n\n      \n    <section class=\"brief-seg\" aria-labelledby=\"seg-overnight\">\n      <div class=\"sign-head\"><span class=\"tab\">Overnight</span><h2 id=\"seg-overnight\">The Kern Overnight</h2></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><p>3 vehicle fires, 3 fires on the highway, 2 mental health crises, and 8 more \u2014 16 incidents total. <a href=\"../../overnight/\">See the full overnight breakdown &rarr;</a></p>\n      <p class=\"note\">Locations generalized to block or cross streets &middot; details preliminary.</p></div>\n      <p class=\"trans-note\">How the Kern Overnight report is made: archived public-safety radio audio is transcribed to text by a speech-to-text model, and the morning report is written from that dispatch log. Locations are generalized to block or cross streets, and every detail is preliminary until confirmed by an official source.</p>\n    </section>\n\n      <section class=\"brief-seg\" aria-labelledby=\"seg-weather\">\n        <div class=\"sign-head\"><span class=\"tab\">Weather</span><h2 id=\"seg-weather\">Today's weather</h2></div>\n        <figure class=\"fig\"><img src=\"../../assets/img/bakersfield.jpg\" alt=\"Golden hour over Bakersfield and the Kern County fields\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\"></figure>\n        <div class=\"card\"><p>Expect a high near 103\u00b0 and a low around 75\u00b0 tonight.</p><p>It's currently 100\u00b0 at Meadows Field (KBFL).</p><p><strong>Flood Advisory</strong>: Flood Advisory issued August 11 at 1:19PM PDT until August 11 at 3:00PM PDT by NWS Hanford CA</p><p>Air quality is 86 \u2014 moderate.</p><p>Fire crews are on 2 active fires in Kern (Buzzard Fire, Antelope Fire).</p></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"brief-seg\" aria-labelledby=\"seg-news\">\n        <div class=\"sign-head\"><span class=\"tab\">News</span><h2 id=\"seg-news\">Top stories</h2></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><ul class=\"story-list\"><li><a href=\"https://www.kget.com/news/local-news/california-city-to-search-for-new-city-manager-amid-ongoing-revolving-door-concerns-for-the-position/\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Top story:</strong> California City to search for new city manager amid ongoing &#x27;revolving door&#x27; concerns for the position \u2014 <em>via KGET 17.</em></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.turnto23.com/news/in-your-neighborhood/tehachapi-stallion-springs/tehachapi-school-administrator-arrested-in-connection-to-child-abuse-case\" rel=\"noopener\">Tehachapi school administrator arrested in connection to child abuse case</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.kget.com/news/crime-watch/tehachapi-school-administrator-arrested-for-failing-to-report-suspected-child-abuse-police/\" rel=\"noopener\">Tehachapi school administrator arrested for failing to report suspected child abuse: police</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.kget.com/news/local-news/2-people-pulled-from-vehicle-after-rollover-crash-along-hwy-178-in-bakersfield/\" rel=\"noopener\">2 people pulled from vehicle after rollover crash along Hwy 178 in Bakersfield: CHP</a></li></ul><p class=\"note\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Summaries are written from the headline and link to the original outlet for details.</p></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"brief-seg\" aria-labelledby=\"seg-good\">\n        <div class=\"sign-head good-head\"><h2 id=\"seg-good\">Something good</h2></div>\n        \n        <div class=\"card pos-card\">\n          <img class=\"thumb\" src=\"../../assets/img/fair.jpg\" alt=\"Kern County Fair\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\